CONFIGURE OBS:
CONFIGURE OBS:
	File -> Settings
		>> Output >> Output Mode: Advanced
			>> Recording >> Type: Standard
			>> Recording >> Recording Format: MKV
			>> Recording >> Video Encoder: QuickSync AV1
			>> Recording >> Audio Track 1,2,3
				>> Encoder Settings >>
					Rate Control: ICQ
					ICQ Quality: 18
					Keyframe Interval: 2s
			>> Audio >>
				Track 1 Name: Everything
				Track 2 Name: Game Only
				Track 3 Name: Microphone only
			>> Replay Buffer >>
				Enabled Reply Buffer
				Maximum Replay Time: 1200s
				Maximum Memory: 3000MB
		>> Hotkeys >>
			Start Replay Buffer: Ctrl + Shift + R
			Stop Replay Buffer: Ctrl + Shift + S
			>> Replay buffer >> Save Replay: F10
		>> Advanced >> 
			>> General >> Process Priority: Above Normal
			>> Video >> Color Format: NV12
			>> Recording >> Automatically remux to mp4
	APPLY SETTINGS
	
	Sources:
		Add new (plus sign)
			-> Game Capture (make sure RuneLite is running)
				-> Add 1 existing >> then double click it 
					>> Mode: capture specific window
					>> Window: [RuneLite.exe] RuneLite
				-> Drag to max view inside display
			-> Audio Input Capture
				-> Device: Open run Headphones
					-> right click and rename: Open Shocks Mic
					-> right click filters
						-> add gain filter +2db
	Audio Mixer:
		-10db for Desktop audio



CONFIGURE RUNELITE:
CONFIGURE RUNELITE:
	Bank 
		-> show exact bank Value
	Bank tab layout
	Bank Tags
	Camera
		-> enable: expand inner zoom limit
		-> enable: expand pitch limit
	daily task indicator
		-> TURN OFF
	Examine
			-> TURN OFF
	GPU
			-> TURN OFF
	Ground Items
		-> enable
	ground markers
	hiscores
	Idle Nofier
	Inventory Tags
	loot tracker
	Menu entry Swapper
	metronome
			-> enabled: despawn timer -> to seconds
